import streamlit as st
from google import genai
from dotenv import load_dotenv
load_dotenv()
st.title("AI MOVIE RECOMMANDATER \n GIVE BEST MOVIE FOR EACH GENRE")
st.subheader("ENTER THE GENRE")

# 1. Language Selection
type1 = st.radio("LANGUAGE", ["HOLLYWOOD", "BOLLYWOOD"])

# 2. Type Selection
type2 = st.radio("TYPE", ["SUB", "DUB"])

# 3. Genre Selection
genre1 = st.radio(
    "GENRE", 
    ["ACTION", "COMEDY", "DRAMA", "HORROR", "ROMANCE", "SCIENCE FICTION"]
)

